{"availability":"available","full":"mithuncreates99/tell-me","name":"tell-me","description":"Habit tracker built around one question: did you show up? Yes/No check-ins and weekly insights. Web app + iPhone app.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-05T22:37:57Z","updated":"2026-10-11T19:36:17Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mithuncreates99.github.io/tell-me/","topics":["capacitor","cloudflare-workers","habit-tracker","ios","portfolio-project","pwa","react","typescript","web-push"],"demo":"https://mithuncreates99.github.io/tell-me/#/demo","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:41.884Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:41.884Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:41.884Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:50:41.884Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A habit tracker built around one question: did you show up?","Write your schedule in plain English. When it's time, your phone asks Yes or No.","Every week you get a report that shows what's working and what isn't."],"features":["Plain-English quick add. Gym Mon Wed Fri 6pm, French class Tue/Thu 19h30, Read daily 22:00, Run 3x a week. You can also paste or import a whole schedule (text, CSV or a backup file).","Native iPhone app. The same app in a native shell (Capacitor). Reminders are scheduled on the phone itself with ✅ Yes / ❌ No buttons right on the notification, with no server at all. Share it through TestFlight or the…","Yes/No push reminders on the web. On Android and desktop Chrome/Edge you answer straight from the notification, without opening the app. On iPhone (Home Screen web app, iOS 16.4+) and Safari you tap the notification to…","Stronger reminders. Per habit: if a check-in is still unanswered 30 minutes later, it asks again, and on computers the notification stays on screen until you answer. Answering on any device cancels the second ask.","Wat